ting a living human body with a splinter. The body will recognize the foreign body and expel it. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The best thing we can do concerning policemen is ignore them. When we can&#39;t ignore them, laugh at them, with all their pomposity and self-importance. (Which they don&#39;t even recognize, or at least, which they fail to admit.) Laughter is the one thing police and Satan can&#39;t stand. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;                   -Sans Authoritas</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/3098470664491040527'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/3098470664491040527'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html?showComment=1235287320000#c3098470664491040527' title=''/><author><name>Sans Authoritas</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1227767387000530517' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1227767387000530517' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 22, 2009 at 12:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3641703006350346943</id><published>2009-02-20T10:39:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-20T10:39:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Chicago!http://www.suntimes.com/news/politics/1440...</title><content type='html'>&lt;B&gt;Chicago!&lt;/B&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.suntimes.com/news/politics/1440402,mayor-daley-emergency-surveillance-cameras.article&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Surveillance cams help fight crime, city says :: CHICAGO SUN-TIMES :: Politics&lt;BR/&gt;PUBLIC SAFETY | Goal is to have them on every corner&lt;BR/&gt;February 19, 2009&lt;BR/&gt;BY FRAN SPIELMAN City Hall Reporter&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Mayor Daley has argued that security and terrorism won’t be an issue if his Olympic dreams come true because, by 2016, there will be a surveillance camera on every street corner in Chicago.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;But even before that blanket coverage begins, the “Big Brother’’ network is being put to better use.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Call takers and dispatchers now see real-time video if there is a surveillance cameras within 150 feet of a 911 call, thanks to a $6 million upgrade to the city’s “computer-aided dispatch” system.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/3641703006350346943'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/3641703006350346943'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html?showComment=1235151540000#c3641703006350346943' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1227767387000530517' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1227767387000530517' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 20, 2009 at 10:39 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3668849775954480064</id><published>2009-02-19T17:04:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-19T17:04:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The photos, they look like swaggering Mafioso.Not ...</title><content type='html'>The photos, they look like swaggering Mafioso.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Not that the Chicago PD would ever be linked with that bunch.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;GOD HAVE MERCY ON US, DELIVER US FROM THE EVIL ONES known as THE &lt;B&gt;G&lt;/B&gt;.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;It&#39;s too late for Elian but not the rest of America.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/3668849775954480064'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/3668849775954480064'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html?showComment=1235088240000#c3668849775954480064' title=''/><author><name>Don&#39;t Trust the G</name><uri>http://gunowners.org/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1227767387000530517' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1227767387000530517' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 19, 2009 at 5:04 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4974723219937876345</id><published>2009-02-19T14:14:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-19T14:14:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>If that fat lard ass had done that to a woman in a...</title><content type='html'>If that fat lard ass had done that to a woman in a bar where I come from (northern NH) one of us mountain folk would have left that fat turd with no front teeth and bruises all over. When you spend your life working in the woods, wielding a chainsaw in all kinds of weather conditions - the Pillsbury Dough Boy  having a temper tantrum -doesn&#39;t pose much of a problem.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/4974723219937876345'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/4974723219937876345'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html?showComment=1235078040000#c4974723219937876345' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1227767387000530517' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1227767387000530517' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 19, 2009 at 2:14 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2090794296337346149</id><published>2009-02-19T13:00:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-19T13:00:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Infiltrating the police department to install libe...</title><content type='html'>Infiltrating the police department to install liberty-minded individuals is a good idea.  So, let&#39;s start doing it!  Are there currently any plans to do this?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/2090794296337346149'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/2090794296337346149'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html?showComment=1235073600000#c2090794296337346149' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1227767387000530517' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1227767387000530517' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 19, 2009 at 1:00 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1567859217838866636</id><published>2009-02-19T06:48:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-19T06:48:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The Chicago police threaten anyone who violates th...</title><content type='html'>The Chicago police threaten anyone who violates the oppressive city and state gun control laws of the region.  I obey the laws because I consider the police to be a bigger threat than the criminals.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/1567859217838866636'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/1567859217838866636'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html?showComment=1235051280000#c1567859217838866636' title=''/><author><name>fsilber</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1227767387000530517' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1227767387000530517' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 19, 2009 at 6:48 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3710801991317925732</id><published>2009-02-19T03:03:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-19T03:03:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It is time to go underground in the police departm...</title><content type='html'>It is time to go underground in the police departments. By this I mean volunteer at the station house as a auxiliary and short circuit the tazer charging systems, sabotage the gear, &quot;loose&quot; paper work, any thing to stop the stupidity. Start a citizen patrol that stands in the way of the police. At last resort &quot;aim small hit small&quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/3710801991317925732'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/3710801991317925732'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html?showComment=1235037780000#c3710801991317925732' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1227767387000530517' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1227767387000530517' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 19, 2009 at 3:03 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1176735796530447686</id><published>2009-02-18T20:52:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-18T20:52:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I think your observation that &quot;the police are at l...</title><content type='html'>I think your observation that &quot;the police are at least as dangerous to life, limb, and property as any of the private sector crime outfits&quot; truly encapsulates the essence of the problem.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Even those that don&#39;t admit it openly know the answer to the problem.  These people, the politicians and the whole lot of them need to be driven from amongst us - at the point of a gun if necessary.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;As the economy continues to collapse we may yet see it in our lifetimes - though it will be nasty, brutal and short as will our lives.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Also, I agree with Bob - I couldn&#39;t believe the bystanders did nothing.  What a society of sheep we&#39;ve become.  Would love to see that fat slob try something like that in Idaho - hopefully he&#39;d be occupying a cooler in the morgue.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Sic Semper Tyrannis</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/1176735796530447686'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/1176735796530447686'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html?showComment=1235015520000#c1176735796530447686' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1227767387000530517' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1227767387000530517' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 18, 2009 at 8:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2657578320247932937</id><published>2009-02-18T10:42:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-18T10:42:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Another great addition to the Rubicon... posts.  W...</title><content type='html'>Another great addition to the Rubicon... posts.  Well done, Mr. Grigg.  Yours is the best source of this information.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Folks,&lt;BR/&gt;Which is it better to be - reactive or proactive?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Perhaps instead of &quot;waiting for them to kick down the door&quot; to initiate our defense, we should be be taking measures now, before things get more out of hand.  City councils, mayors, state legislators, police chiefs, news editors, everyone should be made very aware that continuing on their course of action will result in dire consequences for everyone.  Even though it may seem pointless, letters and emails to these people can still be effective at delaying what some say is inevitable.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Merely reading about this online, commenting on it, and going about your day as usual isn&#39;t enough.  It never has been. To prevent or delay the growth of the police state requires some amount of diligence, even if it&#39;s just a simple email to police chiefs and congressmen.  Proactive measures must be taken.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;But, remember, no Fort Sumters.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/2657578320247932937'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1227767387000530517/comments/default/2657578320247932937'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html?showComment=1234978920000#c2657578320247932937' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/02/rubicon-in-rear-view-pt-iv-chicago.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1227767387000530517' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1227767387000530517' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 18, 2009 at 10:42 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4404514829932571210</id><published>2009-02-18T10:20:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-02-18T10:20:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I&#39;m 10 times as afraid of people who work for the ...</title><content type='html'>I&#39;m 10 ti